{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01368",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.54,
      "end_seconds": 4.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Well, morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.72,
      "end_seconds": 9.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.72,
      "end_seconds": 23.59,
      "duration_seconds": 11.87,
      "text": "Okay, so mainly numbness on the left side of my face. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.27,
      "end_seconds": 27.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.58,
      "end_seconds": 33.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "It's, It's been going on for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.76,
      "end_seconds": 36.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.97,
      "end_seconds": 46.61,
      "duration_seconds": 8.64,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get headache as well. About headache, severe, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.61,
      "end_seconds": 60.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "And what about loss of vision, trouble swallowing or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.41,
      "end_seconds": 63.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.61,
      "end_seconds": 71.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.65,
      "end_seconds": 78.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.4,
      "end_seconds": 97.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Okay, any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.08,
      "end_seconds": 101.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "No, you know, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.1,
      "end_seconds": 105.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.39,
      "end_seconds": 116.35,
      "duration_seconds": 8.96,
      "text": "I'm on rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night. Aspirin. I take it 75 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.21,
      "end_seconds": 126.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "Okay, are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.94,
      "end_seconds": 129.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.86,
      "end_seconds": 133.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.73,
      "end_seconds": 144.42,
      "duration_seconds": 9.69,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I walk the dog every morning. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.1,
      "end_seconds": 149.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.48,
      "end_seconds": 158.85,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "I have high cholesterol, for about ten years. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.58,
      "end_seconds": 163.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.0,
      "end_seconds": 173.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.77,
      "end_seconds": 192.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 37.0, BP is 168 over 101, pulse 91."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.16,
      "end_seconds": 196.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.57,
      "end_seconds": 200.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.86,
      "end_seconds": 222.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "There's mild drooping at the left corner of your mouth."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.48,
      "end_seconds": 226.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "That's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.66,
      "end_seconds": 248.32,
      "duration_seconds": 11.66,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with a possible mini-stroke, which we need to investigate urgently at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.08,
      "end_seconds": 270.94,
      "duration_seconds": 13.86,
      "text": "Let's get an MRI of the brain, for possible stroke. Don't drive for now, and bring someone with you to the next visit. We'll catch up after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.69,
      "end_seconds": 275.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I'll note it in my calendar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.21,
      "end_seconds": 281.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "What are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.37,
      "end_seconds": 288.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.16,
      "end_seconds": 295.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.49,
      "end_seconds": 300.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}